From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: CroqueMr <82093548+CroqueMr@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 21:24:50 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 31/47] avformat/mpegts: treat a descriptor-declared DV profile
 7 EL in private PES as HEVC

Recognize a Dolby Vision profile 7 enhancement layer stream that is
carried as private PES data but declared by its DOVI descriptor, so it
is parsed as HEVC and can be paired with its base layer.

From libreelec-x86-DV R1.0.0-Beta5 (15a14e0b21), CB1/patches/ffmpeg/ffmpeg-9900-04-ts-dovi-layer.patch
https://github.com/CroqueMr/libreelec-x86-DV
---
 libavformat/mpegts.c | 10 ++++++++++
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+)

diff --git a/libavformat/mpegts.c b/libavformat/mpegts.c
index cde8f46c5b..3e7aae02f9 100644
--- a/libavformat/mpegts.c
+++ b/libavformat/mpegts.c
@@ -2507,6 +2507,16 @@ int ff_parse_mpeg2_descriptor(AVFormatContext *fc, AVStream *st, int stream_type
                 struct StreamGroup *stg;
                 int gi;
 
+                /* Profile 7 EL is HEVC even when carried as private PES. */
+                if (stream_type == STREAM_TYPE_PRIVATE_DATA &&
+                    st->codecpar->codec_id == AV_CODEC_ID_BIN_DATA) {
+                    st->codecpar->codec_type = AVMEDIA_TYPE_VIDEO;
+                    st->codecpar->codec_id = AV_CODEC_ID_HEVC;
+                    sti->need_context_update = 1;
+                    sti->need_parsing = AVSTREAM_PARSE_FULL;
+                    sti->request_probe = 0;
+                }
+
                 if (!p)
                     break;
 
